  "description": "U.C. 0096...<br><br>\r\nThe manufacturing colony Industrial 7, which is still under construction, floats at Lagrange point 1.<br><br>\r\nA youth named Banagher Links, who grew up without knowing his father, meets a mysterious girl who has stowed away on a ship bound for Industrial 7. As the white mobile suit Unicorn undergoes repeated tests and becomes the subject of diverse speculations, the hands of time begin to move.<br><br>\r\nBanagher does not yet know that he has been caught up in the conflict surrounding Laplace's Box.<br><br>\r\nWhat is Laplace's Box? <br>\r\nWhat secret does it contain? <br>\r\nThe hundred-year curse of the Universal Century is about to be resolved.<br><br>\r\n(Source: Mobile Suit Gundam Unicorn Official Website)",
